{"repositoryId":1277342720,"availability":"available","full":"neverlane/yaebal","name":"yaebal","description":"yet another tElegram bot api library for node.js (deno and bun TOO!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!)","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-22T20:08:55Z","updated":"2026-10-19T22:19:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://yaebal.mom/playground/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:54.389Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:54.389Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:54.389Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T22:19:54.389Z","stars":8,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["yet another telegram bot api library type-safe · chainable · plugin-first · batteries included","yaebal is a type-safe telegram bot framework for typescript. build your bot as one chain: derive, decorate, install, guard, filters and plugins all carry the context type forward, so handlers see exactly what earlier steps added."],"features":["Bot extends Composer, so there is one middleware engine instead of a bot/router split.","filter queries such as on(\"message:text\") narrow the handler context without casts.","generated contexts give update-specific shortcuts such as ctx.react, ctx.answer, and ctx.editText.","first-party plugins cover sessions, keyboards, callback data, formatting, webhooks, retries, testing, routing and more.","explicit plugin dependencies make wrong install order a type error instead of a production surprise."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neverlane/yaebal/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"db081fcae23540692e6f9c059217e4ce82a2cf17b7c66b8124fe4a91f997d6e2","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:54.451Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:19:54.451Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"yet another telegram bot api library type-safe · chainable · plugin-first · batteries included","sourceUrl":"https://git